  "name": "state_machine_exp",
  "description": "An experimental Rust framework for constructing and verifying systems through a rigorous state machine abstraction. It separates system logic into 'pure' and 'effectful' models, enabling deterministic simulation and side-effect-free testing of complex asynchronous behaviors. The architecture supports modular components for networking, timing, and IO, complemented by a procedural macro for type-safe state traversal and downcasting.",
